Measure the separate effects of 0132 and 0149/0160 with independent candidate-only launch switches.

diff --git a/graphics/nvn/gfx/nvn/rb_texture_ahead.inc b/graphics/nvn/gfx/nvn/rb_texture_ahead.inc
